<Base title="Play · Ujwal Ramesh Karajgikar" description="Side projects and experiments: Next.js apps on Vercel, Figma redesigns, wallet remittance flows." current="play">
  <div class="page hm">
    <h1>Play</h1>
    <p>Side projects and experiments where I try tools and ideas end to end, mostly in Next.js and usually shipped on Vercel. They keep my engineering skills current and give me a feel for what it takes to build the things I specify at work.</p>

    <h2 class="hs">Stack at a glance</h2>
    <div class="chips"><span>Next.js ×3</span><span>MaterialUI ×3</span><span>Vercel ×3</span><span>Supabase ×2</span><span>Firebase ×1</span><span>Figma ×1</span><span>Gemini AI ×1</span></div>

    <h2 class="hs">Projects</h2>
    <div class="it"><small>15 MAY 2025</small><h3>Kelsa - Visual Task Management for Students</h3><p>A visual, drag-and-drop task board for students.</p><div class="tg"><span>Web app</span><span>Next.js</span><span>MaterialUI</span><span>Supabase</span><span>Vercel</span></div></div>
    <div class="it"><small>27 MARCH 2025</small><h3>Instinctive Studio Challenge - Redesigning a Dashboard</h3><p>A redesign of the course-creation page of an existing product, done in Figma as a studio challenge.</p><div class="tg"><span>Design challenge</span><span>Figma</span></div></div>
    <div class="it"><small>6 JUNE 2025</small><h3>Logit - Social Media for Dev Logs</h3><p>A social media web app where developers share their dev logs.</p><div class="tg"><span>Web app</span><span>Next.js</span><span>MaterialUI</span><span>Firebase</span><span>Vercel</span></div></div>
    <div class="it"><small>20 MAY 2025</small><h3>Sync - AI-Powered Voice-To-Text and Summarization</h3><p>A speech summarizer that turns voice into text and then into a short summary.</p><div class="tg"><span>Web app</span><span>Next.js</span><span>MaterialUI</span><span>Supabase</span><span>Gemini AI</span><span>Web Speech API</span><span>Vercel</span></div></div>
    <div class="it"><small>OCTOBER 2026</small><h3>This portfolio</h3><p>A static Astro site with two case studies and a print-friendly layout, built with AI-assisted development.</p><div class="tg"><span>Web</span><span>Astro</span><span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span><span>JavaScript</span></div></div>

    <h2 class="hs">Wallet remittance — flow gallery</h2>
    <p>Low-fi flow designs for onboarding, wallets, top-ups, transfers, and reconciliation. Each flow shows the happy path plus failure and exception handling.</p>
    <div class="flow-grid">
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/onboarding.png" alt="User and customer onboarding flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>User / Customer Onboarding — registration, KYC, screening, compliance decision.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/wallet-creation-iban.png" alt="Wallet creation and virtual IBAN flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Wallet Creation + Virtual IBAN — wallet ID, IBAN request and mapping.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/iban-topup.png" alt="Virtual IBAN top-up flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Virtual IBAN Top-Up — bank transfer, webhook, ledger credit.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/card-topup.png" alt="Card top-up flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Card Top-Up — authorisation, gateway reference, settlement.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/wallet-to-wallet-p2p.png" alt="Wallet to wallet P2P transfer flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Wallet-to-Wallet (P2P) — validation, AML screening, debit and credit.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/transfer-out-iban.png" alt="Transfer out to external bank flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Transfer Out to External Bank — beneficiary screening, cooling-off, compliance.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/cross-border-transfer.png" alt="Cross-border transfer flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Cross-Border Transfer — validation, compliance, partner payout.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/card-purchase.png" alt="Card purchase flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Card Purchase — authorisation, ledger debit, settlement.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/refund.png" alt="Refund flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Refund — merchant initiation, ledger refund, reconciliation.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/reconciliation-settlement.png" alt="Reconciliation and settlement flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Reconciliation &amp; Settlement — scheduled run, matching, exceptions to Ops.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/wallet/compliance-screening.png" alt="Compliance and transaction screening flow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Compliance / Transaction Screening — AML screening, L1/L2 review, audit trail.</figcaption></figure>
    </div>

